# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for all text files, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf. Added 2026-08-24: a mixed CRLF/LF history had inflated
# an unrelated conversation_log.md commit to a whole-file diff (~34k lines changed) instead
# of the ~250 actually added — see conversation_log.md, session 2026-08-24.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary formats in this repo — never line-ending-normalize or diff as text.
*.pdf  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg  binary
*.png  binary
*.ods  binary
